{
  "patthana12.16:0.1": "",
  "patthana12.16:0.2": "",
  "patthana12.16:0.3": "100-14-19. Saraṇaduka-āsavagocchakaṃ ",
  "patthana12.16:1.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ noāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:2.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nanoāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:3.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ nasāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:4.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naanāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:5.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naāsavasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:6.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naāsavavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:7.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naāsavañceva naanāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:8.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naanāsavañceva nano ca āsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:9.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naāsavañceva naāsavavippayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca…pe… nasaraṇaṃ naāsavavippayuttañceva nano ca āsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:10.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naāsavavippayuttaṃ nasāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. ",
  "patthana12.16:11.1": "Nasaraṇaṃ naāsavavippayuttaṃ naanāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca…. "
}
